 "archive.note":["Days without a photo stay part of the record.","기록하지 않은 날도 그대로 남습니다.","Les jours sans photo restent eux aussi dans les archives.","Ook dagen zonder foto blijven zichtbaar."],
 'create.title':["Create an atelier","아틀리에 만들기","Créer un atelier","Atelier maken"],
 "create.name_label":["Atelier name","아틀리에 이름","Nom de l’atelier","Ateliernaam"],
 'create.name_ph':["Atelier name","아틀리에 이름","Nom de l’atelier","Naam van het atelier"],
 'create.capacity_label':["CAPACITY","정원","CAPACITÉ","CAPACITEIT"],
 "create.capacity_explain":["Capacity shapes the composition: {n} people, {n} regions.","인원수가 구도를 정합니다. {n}명이면 {n}개 구역으로 나뉩니다.","Le nombre de personnes détermine la composition : {n} personnes, {n} zones.","Het aantal personen bepaalt de compositie: {n} personen, {n} vlakken."],
 'create.capacity_avg':["Average {px} px per person","1인당 평균 {px} px","En moyenne {px} px par personne","Gemiddeld {px} px per persoon"],
 'create.fixed.title':["Capacity cannot be changed later.","정원은 나중에 바꿀 수 없습니다.","La capacité ne pourra plus être modifiée.","De capaciteit kun je later niet wijzigen."],
 'create.fixed.body':["Capacity is fixed when you create the atelier to keep compositions consistent across works, even as people join.","과거 작품과 구도를 맞추기 위해 만들 때 정원을 고정합니다. 참여자가 늘어도 정원은 바뀌지 않습니다.","La capacité est fixée à la création pour garder une composition cohérente entre les œuvres, même si des personnes rejoignent l’atelier.","De capaciteit ligt vast bij het maken van het atelier, zodat de composities consistent blijven wanneer er mensen bijkomen."],
 'create.submit':["Create this atelier","이 아틀리에 만들기","Créer cet atelier","Dit atelier maken"],
 'created.title':["Atelier created","아틀리에를 만들었습니다","Atelier créé","Atelier gemaakt"],
 'created.body':["Share this code so others can join.","이 코드를 전달하면 다른 사람이 참여할 수 있습니다.","Partagez ce code pour inviter d’autres personnes.","Deel deze code zodat anderen kunnen deelnemen."],
 'created.code_label':["INVITE CODE","초대 코드","CODE D’INVITATION","UITNODIGINGSCODE"],
 'created.copy':["Copy code","코드 복사","Copier le code","Code kopiëren"],
 'created.share':["Share code","코드 공유","Partager le code","Code delen"],
 'created.first_hint':["The first Schiild arrives tomorrow morning.","첫 Schiild는 내일 아침에 만들어집니다.","Le premier Schiild arrive demain matin.","De eerste Schiild verschijnt morgenochtend."],
 'join.title':["Join with a code","코드로 참여","Rejoindre avec un code","Deelnemen met een code"],
 'join.code_ph':["8-character code","8자리 코드","Code à 8 caractères","Code van 8 tekens"],
 'join.preview.stats':["Capacity {cap} / Joined {n} / Works {total}","정원 {cap}명 / 현재 {n}명 / 총 {total}개 작품","Capacité {cap} / Participants {n} / Œuvres {total}","Capaciteit {cap} / Deelnemers {n} / Werken {total}"],
 'join.tomorrow':["Your region will be added tomorrow, not to today’s Schiild.","내 구역은 내일부터 추가됩니다. 오늘의 Schiild에는 반영되지 않습니다.","Votre zone sera ajoutée demain, pas au Schiild du jour.","Je vlak wordt morgen toegevoegd, niet aan de Schiild van vandaag."],
 'join.submit':["Join","참여하기","Rejoindre","Deelnemen"],
 'join.error.not_found':["No atelier found with this code.","이 코드의 아틀리에를 찾을 수 없습니다.","Aucun atelier trouvé avec ce code.","Geen atelier gevonden met deze code."],
