 'push.reveal.body':["The {date} work from {atelier} is ready.","{atelier}의 {date} 작품이 완성되었습니다.","L’œuvre du {date} de {atelier} est prête.","Het werk van {date} uit {atelier} is klaar."],
 'push.custody.title':["Entrusted to you","내가 보관합니다","L’œuvre vous est confiée","Aan jou toevertrouwd"],
 'push.custody.body':["You have been entrusted with the {date} Schiild from {atelier}.","{atelier}의 {date} Schiild를 보관하게 되었습니다.","Le Schiild du {date} de {atelier} vous a été confié.","De Schiild van {date} uit {atelier} is aan jou toevertrouwd."],
 'push.almost.title':["{n} contributions to go","{n}명의 기록이 남았습니다","Encore {n} contributions","Nog {n} bijdragen"],
 'push.almost.body':["{atelier} needs {n} more contributions to complete today.","{atelier}에서 {n}명이 더 기록하면 모두 모입니다.","Il manque {n} contributions dans {atelier} pour ce jour.","Er ontbreken nog {n} bijdragen in {atelier} voor vandaag."],
 'push.self_reminder.title':["Today’s Schiil is still waiting","오늘의 Schiil을 아직 기록하지 않았습니다","Le Schiil du jour vous attend","De Schiil van vandaag wacht nog"],
 "push.self_reminder.body":["Today’s recording window closes in {countdown}.","오늘의 기록은 {countdown} 후 마감됩니다.","Il reste {countdown} pour enregistrer une photo aujourd’hui.","Je hebt nog {countdown} om vandaag een foto vast te leggen."],
 'push.excluded.title':["About today’s Schiil","오늘의 Schiil에 대해","À propos du Schiil du jour","Over de Schiil van vandaag"],
 'push.excluded.body':["It could not be included in the work. See the app for details.","작품에 포함되지 않았습니다. 앱에서 자세한 내용을 확인해 주세요.","Il n’a pas pu être inclus dans l’œuvre. Consultez l’application pour en savoir plus.","Deze kon niet in het werk worden opgenomen. Bekijk de app voor meer informatie."],
 'push.fail.title':["Generation is being retried","다시 생성하고 있습니다","Nouvelle tentative de génération","Het genereren wordt opnieuw geprobeerd"],
 'push.fail.body':["The {date} Schiild from {atelier} will be ready soon.","{atelier}의 {date} Schiild가 곧 완성됩니다.","Le Schiild du {date} de {atelier} sera bientôt prêt.","De Schiild van {date} uit {atelier} is binnenkort klaar."],
