 'settings.delete_account':["Delete account","계정 삭제","Supprimer le compte","Account verwijderen"],
 'delete.title':["Delete your account","계정을 삭제합니다","Supprimer votre compte","Je account verwijderen"],
 'delete.body':["Your Schiils will be deleted. Completed Schiilds and your regions remain in the atelier because finished works cannot be redrawn.","기록한 Schiil은 삭제됩니다. 완성된 Schiild는 다시 그릴 수 없으므로 내 구역과 함께 아틀리에에 남습니다.","Vos Schiils seront supprimés. Les Schiilds terminés et vos zones restent dans l’atelier, car une œuvre achevée ne peut pas être redessinée.","Je Schiils worden verwijderd. Voltooide Schiilds en je vlakken blijven in het atelier, omdat voltooide werken niet opnieuw getekend kunnen worden."],
 'delete.confirm':["Delete","삭제","Supprimer","Verwijderen"],
 'delete.cancel':["Cancel","취소","Annuler","Annuleren"],
